  "draft_py": "# Basilisk Collar (FDN), an Equipment for {1}.\n# \"Equipped creature has deathtouch and lifelink.\"\n# \"Equip {2}\"                              compiled (B5a-equip, sorcery timing), kept\n# M10 Gorgon Flail's / 10E Loxodon Warhammer's B11-attached-pt static (verified) without the P/T\n#   part: one StaticAbility of GRANT_ABILITY steps over \"equipped creature\" (IS_ATTACHED_TO_SOURCE\n#   with TYPE_EQ 'Creature', ALL), keyword grants sorted by name (D23: DEATHTOUCH, LIFELINK, which\n#   is also the printed order).\nequipped = Selector(\n    count=QUnbounded(),\n    mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n    filter=FAnd(\n        children=(\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_ATTACHED_TO_SOURCE),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n        ),\n    ),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n)\ngrants = StaticAbility(\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.DEATHTOUCH),\n                'target': equipped,\n            }),\n            A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.LIFELINK),\n                'target': equipped,\n            }),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\nabilities = [grants, *compiled]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "Equipped creature has deathtouch and lifelink.",
    "ir": "abilities[0] (static GRANT_ABILITY deathtouch, lifelink to the equipped creature)"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Equip {2}",
    "ir": "abilities[1]; keywords[0]"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "B11-attached-pt's static (M10 Gorgon Flail, verified) with the two keyword grants, sorted by name (D23); the compiled equip kept. Pack: tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/basilisk_collar_equipped_bear_kills_and_gains.json."
 },
